This project is a modified derivative of the "skill-inspector" skill from
NVIDIA SkillSpector (https://github.com/NVIDIA/skillspector),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes made to the original:
- SKILL.md rewritten in Portuguese, with a reviewer self-defense section,
  an AI-agent threat model, mandatory REJECT rules, version pinning by sha256,
  batch audit mode and a Windows-safe scanner command.
- Added scripts/checar.py, a read-only, standard-library-only checker for
  attacks against AI agents that SkillSpector's static rules do not cover.
- Added evals/eval.py, an evaluation harness with inert bait skills and
  clean controls.

Atlas-Sentinel does not bundle SkillSpector. It calls the separately
installed `skillspector` command when available.
